sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor R as Reader
  participant B as Browser form (sendForm)
  participant CF as Cloudflare Turnstile
  participant API as /api/submit (Vercel)
  participant ST as Supabase Storage (intake)
  participant DB as Postgres RPC (service role)
  R->>B: fill form, attach files
  B->>CF: execute widget
  CF-->>B: one-time token
  B->>API: {kind, token, args, files meta}
  API->>CF: siteverify(token, secret)
  CF-->>API: success
  alt with attachments
    API->>ST: create signed upload URLs
    API-->>B: uploads[] + signed 30-min ticket
    B->>ST: uploadToSignedUrl (each file)
    B->>API: {kind, ticket, args, files meta}
    API->>API: verify ticket HMAC, expiry, same content
  end
  API->>DB: submit_article / submit_event_report / submit_comment / send_contact_message
  DB->>DB: honeypot, validation, rate limit per email
  DB-->>API: id
  API-->>B: 200 {id}
  B-->>R: success message
